{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<strong><i>Frontier Legends</i></strong><i> is an open-world adventure that combines survival, crafting and exploration in a Wild West setting. You arrive as a new settler on the frontier and are left to fend for yourself as you learn the ways of the West. Tend to your needs, manage resources and explore the wilderness; you just might unravel some of the land\u2019s mysteries along the way.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Over time, you can build your own settlement, defend yourself from outlaws and bandits, form alliances, forge a reputation for good and bad and shape the path that will make you a legend. Do you have what it takes?</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/b878448d335eb28015f080aeff9672ae.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/9bd1fdf95e112cee78f598fcd3d03537.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/9bd1fdf95e112cee78f598fcd3d03537.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/9bd1fdf95e112cee78f598fcd3d03537.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small camp and grow it into a thriving frontier settlement shaped by your leadership. Recruit NPC settlers and assign daily work, farming, crafting, gathering and defense, to keep your town running. Lead well and your community thrives; neglect it and the frontier will catch up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/afedd13a3b32aeda853211166a41d254.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/047809d33b5155a1fcec524e9c35d045.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/047809d33b5155a1fcec524e9c35d045.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/047809d33b5155a1fcec524e9c35d045.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frontier is unforgiving. Manage core needs and resources as you brave a harsh wilderness where the elements, wildlife and outlaws can turn a day trip into a fight for survival. Dynamic weather, day-night cycles and changing conditions require you to adapt every time you ride out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/ec1d22329b702dcd2ddfd0d365f9bb3f.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/3dade18a96269889847ddd8010139166.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/3dade18a96269889847ddd8010139166.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/3dade18a96269889847ddd8010139166.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your Wild West fantasy your way. Become a hunter, trader, builder, bandit, lawman or something in between. Your choices shape your reputation in the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/bcfc3daf7b7f66788101a3629cd689cb.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/e21e70286a6d46e881b9a4097709b0fe.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/e21e70286a6d46e881b9a4097709b0fe.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/e21e70286a6d46e881b9a4097709b0fe.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover wild horses roaming the land, then tame and train them into trusted companions. Each horse has unique attributes and abilities, making them valuable allies and key for traveling, surviving\u00a0 and thriving in the frontier. When in danger, a good mount can be the difference between making it home or meeting the business end of a barrel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/15d00e639030ec5524fd789a44f00627.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/bf8dcb46e5b1031a4b277d75856f9c64.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/bf8dcb46e5b1031a4b277d75856f9c64.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/bf8dcb46e5b1031a4b277d75856f9c64.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push beyond your settlement to explore the unknown and uncover the hidden secrets of the frontier. Take on quests, solve puzzles and hunt legendary treasures as you explore ancient ruins and forgotten camps. Every discovery can change your fate and get you closer to becoming a legend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/b71442f265bc5cccffb38c363d982ef1.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/69f2c63cba8d1db4c7457d04335613ff.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/69f2c63cba8d1db4c7457d04335613ff.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/69f2c63cba8d1db4c7457d04335613ff.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with others to trade, build and survive, or take the darker route: raid, betray and fight your way to a bigger slice of the frontier. Embark on your adventure with other players via cooperative multiplayer, participate in community events and compete in seasonal challenges to earn unique rewards and recognition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become a legend in the Wild West? Forge your path, conquer the frontier and write your own story in Frontier Legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3032150?t=1771367516","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771367516","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/c8d5bef6edb86c84fff8e91ee868eaf592235218/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771367516","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/c8d5bef6edb86c84fff8e91ee868eaf592235218/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771367516","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<strong><i>Frontier Legends</i></strong><i> is an open-world adventure that combines survival, crafting and exploration in a Wild West setting. You arrive as a new settler on the frontier and are left to fend for yourself as you learn the ways of the West. Tend to your needs, manage resources and explore the wilderness; you just might unravel some of the land\u2019s mysteries along the way.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Over time, you can build your own settlement, defend yourself from outlaws and bandits, form alliances, forge a reputation for good and bad and shape the path that will make you a legend. Do you have what it takes?</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/b878448d335eb28015f080aeff9672ae.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/9bd1fdf95e112cee78f598fcd3d03537.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/9bd1fdf95e112cee78f598fcd3d03537.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/9bd1fdf95e112cee78f598fcd3d03537.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small camp and grow it into a thriving frontier settlement shaped by your leadership. Recruit NPC settlers and assign daily work, farming, crafting, gathering and defense, to keep your town running. Lead well and your community thrives; neglect it and the frontier will catch up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/afedd13a3b32aeda853211166a41d254.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/047809d33b5155a1fcec524e9c35d045.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/047809d33b5155a1fcec524e9c35d045.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/047809d33b5155a1fcec524e9c35d045.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frontier is unforgiving. Manage core needs and resources as you brave a harsh wilderness where the elements, wildlife and outlaws can turn a day trip into a fight for survival. Dynamic weather, day-night cycles and changing conditions require you to adapt every time you ride out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/ec1d22329b702dcd2ddfd0d365f9bb3f.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/3dade18a96269889847ddd8010139166.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/3dade18a96269889847ddd8010139166.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/3dade18a96269889847ddd8010139166.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your Wild West fantasy your way. Become a hunter, trader, builder, bandit, lawman or something in between. Your choices shape your reputation in the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/bcfc3daf7b7f66788101a3629cd689cb.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/e21e70286a6d46e881b9a4097709b0fe.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/e21e70286a6d46e881b9a4097709b0fe.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/e21e70286a6d46e881b9a4097709b0fe.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover wild horses roaming the land, then tame and train them into trusted companions. Each horse has unique attributes and abilities, making them valuable allies and key for traveling, surviving\u00a0 and thriving in the frontier. When in danger, a good mount can be the difference between making it home or meeting the business end of a barrel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/15d00e639030ec5524fd789a44f00627.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/bf8dcb46e5b1031a4b277d75856f9c64.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/bf8dcb46e5b1031a4b277d75856f9c64.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/bf8dcb46e5b1031a4b277d75856f9c64.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push beyond your settlement to explore the unknown and uncover the hidden secrets of the frontier. Take on quests, solve puzzles and hunt legendary treasures as you explore ancient ruins and forgotten camps. Every discovery can change your fate and get you closer to becoming a legend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/b71442f265bc5cccffb38c363d982ef1.webp?t=1771367516\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/69f2c63cba8d1db4c7457d04335613ff.poster.avif?t=1771367516\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/69f2c63cba8d1db4c7457d04335613ff.webm?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032150/extras/69f2c63cba8d1db4c7457d04335613ff.mp4?t=1771367516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with others to trade, build and survive, or take the darker route: raid, betray and fight your way to a bigger slice of the frontier. Embark on your adventure with other players via cooperative multiplayer, participate in community events and compete in seasonal challenges to earn unique rewards and recognition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become a legend in the Wild West? Forge your path, conquer the frontier and write your own story in Frontier Legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Neojac Entertainment Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"d